    summary: "Volunteer Definition Volunteers at The Wandering Man offer their time freely to contribute positively to the community without any financial benefit. Opportunities for...",
    html: "<h2><strong>Volunteer Definition</strong></h2>\nVolunteers at The Wandering Man offer their time freely to contribute positively to the community without any financial benefit. Opportunities for volunteering include roles as members, General Volunteers, Online Community Champions, or participants in the Speaker &amp; Ambassador Program.\nWe are dedicated to maintaining the privacy of our volunteers and operate in strict accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and other applicable Australian laws regarding personal information management.\n<h2><strong>Purpose of Collecting, Holding, Using or Disclosing Personal Information</strong></h2>\nWe gather, retain, use, and disclose personal information to facilitate your registration and involvement as a volunteer with our organization.\n<h2><strong>Collection of Personal Information</strong></h2>\nDuring the volunteer registration process, we invite you to provide personal details through an electronic form, which may include your name, address, date of birth, gender identity, qualifications, health information, and reasons for volunteering. Answering most questions on the form is optional.\n<h2><strong>Handling of Personal Information</strong></h2>\nWe manage your personal information in the following manner:\n<ol>\n<li>The information collected is used to:\n<ul>\n<li>Create and manage your volunteer profile, enabling participation;</li>\n<li>Address website management needs, allowing volunteer engagement; and</li>\n<li>Conduct direct marketing activities (only if you have provided your email address and have not chosen to opt-out).</li>\n<li>Facilitate effective volunteer program planning and execution.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>We may share your personal information:\n<ul>\n<li>With our service providers, such as IT and analytics;</li>\n<li>When necessary to prevent threats to life or health;</li>\n<li>As legally required or permitted by Australian law or court/tribunal orders.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\nWe avoid direct overseas disclosure of personal information. However, our service providers may handle personal information internationally for service delivery.\nHealth information is disclosed strictly for the purposes for which it was provided, related purposes that are reasonably expected, or with your consent.\n<h2><strong>Our Website and Mobile Applications </strong></h2>\nOur Privacy Policy provides detailed information on the use of cookies, Google Analytics, Facebook analytics, SiteImprove analytics, and marketing tools on our websites and applications.\n<h2><strong>Non-Provision of Personal Information </strong></h2>\nIf you are unable to provide certain essential personal information, it may impact your ability to volunteer with us.\n<h2><strong>Our Privacy Policy </strong></h2>\nOur Privacy Policy details further collection, holding, use, and disclosure practices for personal information, including how you can access and correct your information and lodge complaints regarding privacy breaches or our handling of your personal information.\n<h2><strong>Contacting Us</strong></h2>\nFor questions or more information\nEmail: hello@thewanderingman.com.au\n<h2><strong>Changes to the Statement</strong></h2>\nThis Volunteer Privacy Collection Statement is current as of February 2024. Amendments may be made periodically, with updated versions to be published on our website, effective from the date of posting.",
